    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\ntabline\n\n### Description\n\ntabline is not loading when starting neovim, but it loads regularly when sourcing my init.vim \n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.9.1-3\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. launch neovim with plugin itchyny/lightline.vim installed: tabline won't load.\r\n2. source ~/.config/nvim/init.vim: tabline loads.\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nexpected regular loading at launch\n\n### Actual behavior\n\ntabline loads normally provided I don't use itchyny/lightline.vim plugin - to my knowledge it's the only factor in my config preventing tabline to load.",
